  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-01T03:14:15.210Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Because of the version of EAC that VRChat uses one can not launch other games that use EAC. It throws the following error when trying to launch other EAC games. \n\nError Code: 20011 (An incompatible Easy Anti-Cheat service is already running. Please exit other running games or reboot)\n\nThere is no solution to this unless VRChat makes the change to the widely utilized version. I can not launch Dead by Daylight nor Fortnite at the same time VRChat is running as an example. However, I can run Fortnite and Dead by Daylight together without issue.\n\nI noticed VRChat EAC executable is named \"EasyAntiCheat_EOS_Setup\" whereas in the other two games I mentioned the executable is named \"EasyAntiCheat_Setup\"",
